# Patches carried by the 3.10 stream — the <patch> part of feature/3.10/<patch>.
# Authoritative: bin/proscala-rebase-tree rebuilds trunk/3.10 from exactly these.
# See AGENTS.md ("The stream feature lists"). Order is irrelevant; blank lines
# and #-comments are ignored. Do not list `make` (the build lives on `main`).

